---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import {site} from '../data/site';
---
<Layout title="預約與洽詢｜中鼎文物">
  <section class="page-heading dark"><span class="eyebrow gold">CONTACT & APPOINTMENT</span><h1>預約與洽詢</h1><p>告訴我們您感興趣的作品，<br/>或希望討論的合作需求。</p></section>
  <section class="section contact-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">GET IN TOUCH</span><h2>每一次合作，<br/>都從了解開始。</h2><dl class="contact-details"><div><dt>電話</dt><dd><a href={'tel:'+site.tel}>{site.phone}</a></dd></div><div><dt>電子郵件</dt><dd><a href={'mailto:'+site.email}>{site.email}</a></dd></div><div><dt>接待地址</dt><dd>{site.address}</dd></div><div><dt>營業時間</dt><dd>{site.hours}<small>參訪請先預約，實際安排以聯絡確認為準。</small></dd></div></dl></div><form id="inquiry-form" data-email={site.email}><h3>留下您的需求</h3><div class="form-row"><label>姓名<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100" /></label><label>電子郵件<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="200" /></label></div><label>洽詢類型<select name="topic"><option>文物藝術</option><option>資訊科技</option><option>國際貿易</option><option>圖鑑出版</option><option>其他合作</option></select></label><label>洽詢內容<textarea name="message" rows="6" required maxlength="6000" placeholder="可填寫作品名稱、預約意願、產品規格或合作需求。"></textarea></label><button class="button dark-button" type="submit">開啟郵件洽詢</button><p class="small-note">此表單會開啟您的郵件程式，請在郵件程式中確認並寄出；網站不會自動送出或儲存內容。也可直接寄信至上方信箱。</p><p id="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p><noscript><p>若無法使用表單，請直接來信或來電洽詢。</p></noscript></form></section>
  <script>
    const form=document.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('#inquiry-form');
    if(form){const query=new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);const item=query.get('item');const topic=query.get('topic');const select=form.elements.namedItem('topic') as HTMLSelectElement;const message=form.elements.namedItem('message') as HTMLTextAreaElement;if(topic&&Array.from(select.options).some(o=>o.value===topic))select.value=topic;if(item)message.value='您好，我希望洽詢「'+item+'」。\n';form.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!form.reportValidity())return;const d=new FormData(form);const subject='中鼎文物洽詢｜'+d.get('topic');const body=`姓名：${d.get('name')}\n電子郵件：${d.get('email')}\n\n${d.get('message')}`;window.location.href='mailto:'+form.dataset.email+'?subject='+encodeURIComponent(subject)+'&body='+encodeURIComponent(body);const status=document.querySelector('#form-status');if(status)status.textContent='已請求開啟郵件程式，請確認郵件並自行寄出。若沒有開啟，請直接使用上方電子郵件地址。';});}
  </script>
</Layout>
